WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.714 --> 00:00:20.317
laughed. "It's fine if your tiny friend is on another planet, Rocket Girl.

2
00:00:20.638 --> 00:00:21.678
We'll just get him."

3
00:00:22.979 --> 00:00:23.879
Roxy shook her head.

4
00:00:23.899 --> 00:00:26.441
"He's not on another planet.

5
00:00:27.421 --> 00:00:30.483
He's in another world, like a different universe."

6
00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:32.084
She groaned.

7
00:00:32.676 --> 00:00:37.159
"If only there was a way to—" "Oh, so we need a portal?"

8
00:00:37.519 --> 00:00:38.359
Cozlin asked.

9
00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:40.560
Roxy raised an eyebrow.

10
00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:44.382
"You know how to get a portal to another world?"

11
00:00:46.063 --> 00:00:46.884
Cozlin laughed.

12
00:00:47.744 --> 00:00:49.465
"Of course!

13
00:00:49.925 --> 00:00:52.127
Doesn't Earth use portal technology?"

14
00:00:52.147 --> 00:00:54.608
"No," Roxy said.

15
00:00:55.568 --> 00:00:56.589
Cozlin shook her head.

16
00:00:56.609 --> 00:00:59.430
"Your planet is strange."

17
00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:03.881
"Strange, you," Bippo said to Roxy.

18
00:01:03.901 --> 00:01:06.143
"Hey!" Roxy said.

19
00:01:06.163 --> 00:01:07.984
"That's not nice."

20
00:01:09.426 --> 00:01:10.366
Bippo looked down.

21
00:01:10.386 --> 00:01:13.169
"Sorry, me."

22
00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:15.731
"How will we get a portal?"

23
00:01:16.171 --> 00:01:17.152
Dr. Odd asked.

24
00:01:17.172 --> 00:01:21.896
"Rocket Girl and I will go to the planet Hulzar," Cozlin said.

25
00:01:21.916 --> 00:01:26.720
"The Hulzarians are the galaxy's best portal makers."

26
00:01:28.001 --> 00:01:29.042
Her shoulders slumped.

27
00:01:30.202 --> 00:01:31.744
"But I just remembered something.

28
00:01:32.768 --> 00:01:35.069
We don't have a spaceship to get there."

29
00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:38.832
"I have spaceships," Dr.

30
00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:39.452
Odd said.

31
00:01:39.472 --> 00:01:42.634
"But they can't escape the magnetic energy here."

32
00:01:43.714 --> 00:01:44.455
Roxy grinned.

33
00:01:44.475 --> 00:01:47.777
"I can carry the spaceship into space.

34
00:01:48.877 --> 00:01:50.298
I have superstrength."

35
00:01:50.318 --> 00:01:53.320
"Me too," Cozlin said quickly.

36
00:01:55.841 --> 00:01:57.522
Dr. Odd led them to a large room.

37
00:01:58.603 --> 00:02:00.504
He opened the hatch of a small spaceship.

38
00:02:01.564 --> 00:02:03.726
"You can take this one."

39
00:02:03.766 --> 00:02:08.088
"Great!" Roxy lifted the spaceship.

40
00:02:09.289 --> 00:02:11.010
Bippo held tightly to her shoulder.

41
00:02:12.471 --> 00:02:14.072
She flew up and away from the moon.

42
00:02:18.015 --> 00:02:20.136
us!" Bippo said.

43
00:02:20.156 --> 00:02:22.318
"That's right, Bippo!"

44
00:02:22.618 --> 00:02:23.279
Roxy said.

45
00:02:23.299 --> 00:02:26.160
"We are really—Uh-oh!"

46
00:02:27.141 --> 00:02:32.184
Despite using all her superstrength, Roxy couldn't keep moving away from Groon.

47
00:02:32.204 --> 00:02:35.006
The magnetic energy pulled her back down to the surface.

48
00:02:38.908 --> 00:02:41.389
Roxy slammed into a pile of scrap metal near Dr.

49
00:02:41.509 --> 00:02:42.030
Odd's moon.

50
00:02:45.552 --> 00:02:46.532
Cozlin flew over.

51
00:02:46.552 --> 00:02:47.933
"Let me try."

52
00:02:49.754 --> 00:02:51.455
She lifted the spaceship and flew up.

53
00:02:52.616 --> 00:02:54.497
A moment later she fell back down too.

54
00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:00.000
she said.

55
00:03:00.812 --> 00:03:03.273
"That magnetic energy is too strong!

56
00:03:04.473 --> 00:03:06.994
We can't get this spaceship off Groon."

57
00:03:08.114 --> 00:03:09.194
Roxy gritted her teeth.

58
00:03:09.214 --> 00:03:11.675
"We don't have a choice."

59
00:03:13.756 --> 00:03:16.196
She picked up the spaceship and shot into the sky again.

60
00:03:17.277 --> 00:03:19.997
After a few seconds, she fell with another crash.

61
00:03:20.918 --> 00:03:25.299
Cozlin tried again too, but the magnetic energy quickly dragged her back to the surface.

62
00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:28.580
She stomped her foot.

63
00:03:30.536 --> 00:03:32.618
"You two are being silly," Dr.

64
00:03:32.698 --> 00:03:33.178
Odd said.

65
00:03:33.198 --> 00:03:35.661
"Why don't you work together?"

66
00:03:38.323 --> 00:03:39.464
Roxy grinned sheepishly.

67
00:03:39.484 --> 00:03:41.426
"That's a good idea."

68
00:03:43.167 --> 00:03:43.988
Cozlin shrugged.

69
00:03:44.008 --> 00:03:49.472
"Sure." The two superheroes lifted the spaceship and flew upward.

70
00:03:51.314 --> 00:03:54.617
For a moment Roxy felt the magnetic force pulling at the spaceship.

71
00:03:55.658 --> 00:04:00.104
She pushed harder, and so did Cozlin.

72
00:04:00.124 --> 00:04:01.225
Soon they were out in space.

73
00:04:01.245 --> 00:04:04.746
"We did it!"

74
00:04:05.046 --> 00:04:05.606
Roxy said.

75
00:04:05.626 --> 00:04:09.288
"Partners, you," Bippo said.

76
00:04:10.868 --> 00:04:11.829
Cozlin smiled.

77
00:04:12.929 --> 00:04:15.170
"Yes, I guess we are partners."

78
00:04:16.991 --> 00:04:19.612
They got into the spaceship and turned on a communication device.

79
00:04:19.632 --> 00:04:22.913
"We did it, Dr.

80
00:04:23.093 --> 00:04:24.214
Odd!" Roxy said.

81
00:04:24.234 --> 00:04:26.155
"We'll be back soon."

82
00:04:26.175 --> 00:04:30.328
"I'll work on the plan while you're gone," Dr.

83
00:04:30.428 --> 00:04:30.928
Odd said.

84
00:04:30.948 --> 00:04:33.530
"Good luck."

85
00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:35.310
Cozlin set a course for Hulzar.

86
00:04:37.611 --> 00:04:39.632
Then she pulled a power crystal from her pocket.

87
00:04:39.652 --> 00:04:44.014
"This will give the spaceship's engine a boost," she said.

88
00:04:45.014 --> 00:04:47.115
She inserted it into the spaceship's controls.

89
00:04:55.179 --> 00:04:59.017
An hour later they were landing in the capital city of Hulzar.

90
00:04:59.037 --> 00:05:02.406
Roxy saw lots of buildings, but the whole place seemed to be empty.

91
00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:04.372
Roxy frowned.

92
00:05:04.392 --> 00:05:06.739
"Where is everyone?"
